**Version**: 0.1
**Created**: 2026-08-13
**Status**: Draft — awaiting the architect's ratify on the four open forks (six DD nodes: [DD-CQ-BRIDGELESS-CHILD] ratified by David 2026-08-13, [DD-CQ-MONITOR-LOCATION] settled 2026-08-11)
